Subject: [PATCH] drm/vmwgfx: add ABGR8888 to vmw_primary_plane_formats[]

Based on FydeOS kernel patch

Change-Id: If740facd93cd7a715cca2cc98b761b6764bbeaa9
Signed-off-by: hmtheboy154 <buingoc67@gmail.com>
